    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Id'fix, in Trans-en-Provence, is a salon experienced with long-haired dogs, which need more meticulous care than short coats. One positive review praises the punctuality and welcome given to a basset hound.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: several directories now place this salon at the Centre Commercial Arcadia (555 route de Draguignan) rather than at 29 avenue de la Gare — call before heading over to confirm the current address, it could be a recent move.</div>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>If your dog has a long coat prone to matting (Collie, Beauceron, Cocker Spaniel...), this salon is used to that type of care.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: between salon visits, regular brushing prevents mats that form quickly with a long coat, especially by the sea with salt and sand.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Trans-en-Provence, a small village near Draguignan, is accessible from avenue de la Gare.</p>
